For an international organization in New York, we are urgently looking for a REMOTE Senior Ionic/Angular Developer. Candidates need to be fluent in English. All positions are long-term. This position is open for freelancers and employees.
Candidates need to be able to work normal office hours in New York, US. Example 9 AM NY time equals 7:30 PM.
During the corona crisis, interviews will be done through WEBEX, and travel is not required for the interviews. All positions are long-term.
Tasks and Responsibilities:

• Work with an agile team to design, develop, test, debug, implement and maintain applications using ICT standard web-based and client-server development frameworks and technologies mainly Ionic, PWA, AngularJS/Angular, Node.js, TypeScript, HTML/CSS/SASS, JSON/XML/Ajax, GitLab;

• Carry out required testing and quality assurance and ensure that deliverables meet software requirements based on agreed time frame and milestones;

• Develop cross-browser and cross-platform front-end web development including HTML, JavaScript, CSS, and the latest technologies;

• Communicate technical solutions/concepts with trade-offs, risks, and benefits;

• Develop proof of concepts and prototypes which match industry standards;

Profile:

• Bachelor or Master degree;

• Proven track record working in an agile remote team with task-based deliveries;

• 8+ years of experience with front end web development technologies;

• 7+ years of hands-on experience in converting wireframes to web pages using Angular framework is required;

• 3+ years of experience using Ionic/angular framework, especially on versions 4+;

• 7+ years of experience in integrating front end with web services, RESTful API’s backend technologies such as C#, node.js, python;

• 4+ years of experience in Angular 2+;

• Experience in angular-CLI commands and build tools using npm;

• Fluent in English;

